      ],
      "behavior": "The shipped call is Taskbar.primary False. One available family restores when minimized, minimizes when active, otherwise activates. Multiple families open a picker. Empty groups return Unavailable in this fixture; pinned launch is a function-level branch not reached by the shipped call.",
